[00:00.000 --> 00:06.680]  Doing a quick little experiment today with three three phase wire coils and a 50
[00:06.680 --> 00:11.240]  millimetre magnet in the middle or a little wooden pole with an eight
[00:11.240 --> 00:15.560]  millimetre aluminum ball at top and when I spend the magnet I want to see how it
[00:15.560 --> 00:20.840]  goes up and presses against the ball. This kind of pole ball structure was seen
[00:20.840 --> 00:27.000]  in the CT scan of a real UFO orb and lies behind me my son and his colleagues
[00:27.000 --> 00:34.320]  in Mexico a few weeks ago so let's start spinning the magnet. It rises up quite
[00:34.320 --> 00:49.320]  quickly and then it reaches the ball at the top and still keeps spinning it's
[00:49.320 --> 01:19.160]  been a little faster and faster and faster like a boat propelder. So this is
[01:19.160 --> 01:23.420]  just a preliminary experiment I'll do it properly when I get some more parts in a
[01:23.420 --> 01:27.920]  few days. Thank you to the stars.
